332 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 109 0 R
/T (Caption Structure 1. HOOK \(first line\):  Bold statement, surprising stat, question, or promise. Platforms truncate after 2-3 lines. The hook determines if people click 'See more'.  2. VALUE \(body\): Deliver on the hook. Share insight, a key takeaway, or a story.  Keep it concise. 3-5 short paragraphs max. Use line breaks for readability. 3. CALL TO ACTION \(ending\): Always end with a clear, low-friction action:  visit a link, answer a question, tag someone, subscribe, or read the full article.)
/E (Caption Structure 1. HOOK \(first line\):  Bold statement, surprising stat, question, or promise. Platforms truncate after 2-3 lines. The hook determines if people click 'See more'.  2. VALUE \(body\): Deliver on the hook. Share insight, a key takeaway, or a story.  Keep it concise. 3-5 short paragraphs max. Use line breaks for readability. 3. CALL TO ACTION \(ending\): Always end with a clear, low-friction action:  visit a link, answer a question, tag someone, subscribe, or read the full article.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [3]
>>
