<<
/Title (Caption Structure 1. HOOK \(first line\):  Bold statement, surprising stat, question, or promise. Platforms truncate after 2-3 lines. The hook determines if people click 'See more'.  2. VALUE \(body\): Deliver on the hook. Share insight, a key takeaway, or a story.  Keep it concise. 3-5 short paragraphs max. Use line breaks for readability. 3. CALL TO ACTION \(ending\): Always end with a clear, low-friction action:  visit a link, answer a question, tag someone, subscribe, or read the full article.)
/Dest [16 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 2159 0 R
>>
endobj
